      "content": "REST API providing programmatic access to millions of digitized Smithsonian collection objects, metadata, images, and 3D models across 19 museums and research centers. All content is released under CC0 (public domain). Supports search, content retrieval, and term browsing. An API key from api.data.gov is required for all requests.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Smithsonian Open Access Team\n Email: openaccess@si.edu",
